"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#153d35\"><title>EDUCATE Tuition Centre · Rajajinagar | Website preview</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\"><script src=\"app.js\" defer></script></head><body>\n<div class=\"strip\">Rajajinagar, Bengaluru <span>Independent website preview</span></div>\n<header><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Educate Tuition Centre home\"><span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">E</span><span>EDUCATE<small>TUITION CENTRE</small></span></a><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#classes\">Classes</a><a href=\"#experience\">Reviews</a><a href=\"#visit\">Visit</a></nav><a class=\"button dark\" href=\"#callback\">Book a call</a></header>\n<main><section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"herotext\"><div class=\"cap\"><b></b> TUITION FOR CLASSES 8–10</div><h1>Big questions.<br><em>Clear answers.</em></h1><p>State and CBSE tuition in Rajajinagar for students who want time to ask, practise and understand.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button dark\" href=\"#classes\">Find your class</a><a class=\"line\" href=\"tel:+917026335245\">Call the centre</a></div></div><figure><img src=\"classroom.webp\" alt=\"Illustrative classroom scene with a tutor helping two students work through a problem\"><figcaption>Classroom illustration</figcaption></figure></section>\n<div class=\"facts\"><div><strong>5.0 <i>★</i></strong><span>101 Google reviews¹</span></div><div><strong>State &amp; CBSE</strong><span>Boards served</span></div><div><strong>Women-owned</strong><span>Listed on Google Maps</span></div></div>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"classes\"><p class=\"cap\"><b></b> CLASSES</p><h2>Where is your child <em>starting?</em></h2><p>Choose a class to prepare an enquiry for the centre.</p><div class=\"cards\">\n<article><div class=\"symbol\">x²</div><h3>Class 8</h3><p>Ask about help with the concepts your child finds difficult at school.</p><a href=\"#enquiry\" data-grade=\"8\">Enquire for Class 8</a></article>\n<article><div class=\"symbol\">√x</div><h3>Class 9</h3><p>Discuss subject support, practice and how the teacher tracks progress.</p><a href=\"#enquiry\" data-grade=\"9\">Enquire for Class 9</a></article>\n<article><div class=\"symbol\">π</div><h3>Class 10</h3><p>Ask how tuition can support revision and preparation for board exams.</p><a href=\"#enquiry\" data-grade=\"10\">Enquire for Class 10</a></article></div></section>\n<section id=\"experience\" class=\"reviews\"><div><p class=\"cap\"><b></b> STUDENT &amp; PARENT VOICES</p><h2>Room to <em>ask why.</em></h2><p>Families describe patient explanations, individual attention and regular tests in their Google reviews.</p></div><blockquote>“Doubts are always encouraged, and they are explained until I fully understand, which makes learning stress-free.”<cite>Student feedback · Google Maps</cite></blockquote></section>\n<section class=\"section enquiry\" id=\"enquiry\"><div><p class=\"cap\"><b></b> ADMISSIONS ENQUIRY</p><h2>Ask about <em>a batch.</em></h2><p>Choose your child’s class and board. Copy the question to share yourself, <a class=\"line\" href=\"#callback\">book a demo callback</a>, or call the centre to discuss fees and timings.</p></div><div class=\"form\"><div class=\"row\"><label>Class<select id=\"grade\"><option value=\"8\">Class 8</option><option value=\"9\">Class 9</option><option value=\"10\">Class 10</option></select></label><label>Board<select id=\"board\"><option>Karnataka State</option><option>CBSE</option></select></label></div><label>Your enquiry<textarea id=\"message\" rows=\"4\" readonly></textarea></label><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"button dark\" id=\"copy\">Copy enquiry</button><a class=\"line\" href=\"tel:+917026335245\">Call 70263 35245</a></div><small role=\"status\" id=\"status\"></small></div></section>\n<section class=\"section enquiry\" id=\"callback\"><div><p class=\"cap\"><b></b> CALLBACK REQUEST</p><h2>Book a <em>call.</em></h2><p>Ask for a call about your child’s class and board. This is a demonstration. Use a sample phone number. For an actual admissions call, contact the centre directly.</p></div>\n<form id=\"callform\" class=\"form\"><label>Callback number (10 digits)<input type=\"tel\" name=\"phone\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[6-9][0-9]{9}\" placeholder=\"9876543210\" required></label><div class=\"row\"><label>Class<select name=\"grade\"><option>8</option><option>9</option><option>10</option></select></label><label>Board<select name=\"board\"><option>Karnataka State</option><option>CBSE</option></select></label></div><label>Preferred call time (India time)<select name=\"slot\"><option>Morning (10 AM–12 PM)</option><option>Afternoon (12–4 PM)</option><option>Evening (4–7 PM)</option></select></label><button class=\"button dark\" type=\"submit\">Book demo callback</button><p role=\"status\" id=\"callstatus\"></p></form></section><section class=\"visit\" id=\"visit\"><div><p class=\"cap\"><b></b> VISIT THE CENTRE</p><h2>Find us in <em>Rajajinagar.</em></h2></div><div><address>N Block, 60/A 1st, Dr Rajkumar Road,<br>Rajajinagar, Bengaluru 560010</address><a class=\"line\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=EDUCATE+Tuition+Centre+60%2FA+Dr+Rajkumar+Road+Rajajinagar+Bengaluru\">Open Google Maps</a></div></section></main><footer><a href=\"/admin\">Staff admin</a> EDUCATE Tuition Centre <small>¹ Rating from the supplied Google Maps listing, 21 November 2026. Independent design proposal.</small></footer></body></html>\n"